'''Summer by the Sea''' (湘南の海, ''Shōnan no Umi'', '''Sea of Shōnan''') was a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (L): Cat Base health is increased by 100%.

==Combo==
