==Trivia==
*Summer By the Seas' Japanese name, Shōnan no Umi (湘南の海, "Sea of Shōnan"), referred to [[wikipedia:Shōnan|Shōnan]], a region along the coast of Sagami Bay in Kanagawa Prefecture, central Japan popular for yachting and water sports.

